1 0 obj<</Author(ST4RWYNN)/CreationDate(D:20261101035551+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Not Rated, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Catra & Melog \(She-Ra\), \(Mentioned\) Catra/Adora, \(Implied\) Catra/Adora, Adora/Catra \(She-Ra\), Catra Applesauce Meowmeow - Character, Melog - Character, \(Mentioned\) Adora Happysmile Rainbowfist, \(Mentioned\) Glimmer Moon, \(Mentioned\) Bow Woods, Therapy Cat Melog \(She-Ra\), They/Them pronouns Melog, Melog is NB, Melog refers to themselves using 'us/we/our' and uses names and 'she/her/he/him/they/them' instead of 'you/your', This is how i envision Melog's characterization to be, I also gave Glimmer and Bow last names, because nobles, especially Kings and Princesses and Queens, are generally supposed to have last names, Right?, though it isn't explicitly stated in the fic, Glimmer's last name is Moon, and Bow is Bow Woods, Slice of Life, I think?, Melog is like an ancient being who knows nothing about regular customs, they're clueless, Comparable to modern characterization of biblically accurate angels tbh, yay!, F/F, Choose Not To Use Archive Warnings)/ModDate(D:20261101035551+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Our name is Melog)>>
endobj
